<title>USA: STM names Joseph Wallace as CFO.</title>
<headline>STM names Joseph Wallace as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>STM Wireless Inc said Monday that Joseph Wallace joined the company as chief financial officer on March 11.</p>
<p>Wallace replaces Preston Romm, who resigned at the end of 1996 to pursue other interests, the company said.</p>
<p>Wallace, 37, most recently served as corporate controller of MAI Systems Corp, a provider of total information system solutions for the hospitality and manufacturing industries.</p>
